# Project workflow: Digital Innovation Agents

This repository follows the DIA V-Model workflow.

- Mode: `{{mode}}`
- Settings: `.dia/config.toml`
- Skills: see `skills/dia-bootstrap/SKILL.md`

Default to `/dia-guide` for orientation. Phase skills are
`/business-analysis`, `/requirements-engineering`, `/architecture`,
`/coding`, `/testing`, `/security-audit`.

Small bug fixes may use the Hotfix lane (max 3 files, no breaking
change, fits an existing FEAT) as long as the corresponding FIX-Row
and GitHub issue are created right after.

Run `/dia-setup` to change the mode or remove this section.
